  "body": "Direct-PR: one label line, created on the repository on the operator's request\n\n**Problem.** The operator asked on 2026-11-08 to tag legacy behaviours to keep as such; no label existed, and `.github/labels.yml` is the only place labels are defined (AGENTS.md §7).\n\n**Change.** In `.github/labels.yml`, one line: `legacy finding`, colour `8e44ad`, next to `beta-test finding`. The label was created on the repository the same day with the same values, and is on #594, #651, #652, #653, #654, #655.\n\nPlus one sentence in AGENTS.md §7, after the `beta-test finding` one.\n\n**Tests.** `pre-commit` on the file passes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CJ1auuPWv2FeT7Q4Ps\n",
